WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.740
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:07.010
When you watch Kaleido Star, I want you
to keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.570
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.680
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.920
Do you have something
you want to be in the future?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.290
A school teacher? A doctor?

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.020
You must have all kinds of dreams
what you want to be.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.420
Doing something you want to do
is a very difficult thing to do.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.360
But, let's have a good attitude and
never give up on what you want to do.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.990
Let's have! Let's have!

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.400
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.400
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.910
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.910
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:45.610
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:45.610
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:59.960
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:59.960
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:06.330
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:06.330
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:15.040
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:15.040
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:21.570
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:21.570
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.890
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.890
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:36.430
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:36.430
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.470
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.470
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:45.970
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:45.970
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:56.440
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:56.440
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.150
An Amazing Sinister Rumor

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.150
"An Amazing Sinister Rumor"

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:03.170
An Amazing Sinister Rumor

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:09.560
And now, I present to you, my home page!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:11.330
Wow, it's so cute.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.120
But don't you think this picture of
Kaleido Stage is kinda skewed?

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.530
Don't worry.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:17.520
I already got permission from the Boss.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.130
It's amazing.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.670
I'm planning on putting up
everyone's pictures in the gallery.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:25.930
In particular, Anna's pictures
have special features.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.170
When did you take these pictures?

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.610
When Anna flubs a gag,

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.140
that's the best time to take a picture.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.150
So, are you going to post everyone's picture?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.050
Well... That was my plan, but...

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.050
What?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:42.220
Someone quits every day lately. So...

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.160
What?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.790
Didn't you hear?

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.560
The other day, three people quit at one time.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:54.100
I'll be very disappointed if someone quits
as soon as I post the picture on the website.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.140
So,

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:59.130
Lately I'm concentrating my energies
on writing original stories.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.040
Original stories?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:01.880
That's right.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:05.810
Cute stories, scary stories, etcetera, etcetera.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.220
How about something funny?

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.310
Nope!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.980
Sora, you have a guest.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.280
Oh, yes.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.460
She looks Japanese.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.890
Japanese? I wonder who she could be.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:18.390
She said she would wait for you in the lobby.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:19.880
Okay. Thank you.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.790
I wonder if she was in
the rhythmic gymnastics club.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:27.140
Well...

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:27.970
Oh!

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.930
Excuse me...

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.340
You're late.

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:34.040
I got tired of waiting for you.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.670
Manami...

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.180
What? Did I bother you showing up here?

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:42.420
No, no. Not at all.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.510
I'm glad you came.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.320
It isn't comfortable standing here,

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.160
so why don't we have
a cup of coffee somewhere?

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.230
Yes, yes.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:52.660
You just need to be back here before
the evening performance starts. Right?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:53.660
Yes, yes.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:54.460
Sora...

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:55.460
Huh?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.290
You should go change your clothes quickly.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.730
Oh, that's right. Excuse me...

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.340
Why did you come here, Manami?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.640
I was chosen as an exchange student,

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.310
and I'm going to stay
in Boston for three months.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.280
Really?

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.150
As usual, you're doing well at school.

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:16.240
Of course. I've been studying hard.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.390
When it comes to studying,
I stand no chance against you, Manami.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:21.860
Well maybe it's because

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.760
you were the only one going
to English Conversation School

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.730
while everybody else was in cram school.

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.130
You can't expect to keep
your grades up doing that.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:31.500
Yeah... That's what you'd tell me
all the time.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:34.100
But, I was a little surprised today.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:34.940
What?

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:38.570
I never expected you to play a lead role.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.280
When you said that you'd be a Kaleido Star,

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.510
I thought it was ridiculous.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.250
Who ever thought that you'd really do it?

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.420
Well... I'm not exactly at that point
where you can call me a star.

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.250
This time,

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:52.690
I just happened to be lucky enough
to co-star with Miss Layla, and...

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.050
Oh, so that's it.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.720
Don't you have any regrets?

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:02.900
What?

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.940
No, I don't have any regrets.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:13.030
I think I would have regretted it more
if I'd just stayed in Japan.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.670
I see...

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.880
Did something happen?

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:17.950
What do you mean, "something"?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.920
Well, I just wondered if you're having
a hard time deciding what you should do.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.880
'Cause someone who's always
confident like you...

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.240
Don't you think that sounds rude?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.390
You think so?

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:29.520
You're treating me like an idiot
who has nothing to worry about.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.860
Oh... I never meant it like that.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:33.350
Well, never mind.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.700
Well, it's almost the time to go.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.830
During your evening performance,
I will wait for you backstage.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.840
What? Wait for me?

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:41.770
Yes.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.140
I'm going to stay in your room tonight.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:44.970
What?

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.030
I didn't make a hotel reservation.

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:47.870
Oh. Really...

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.640
This is our backstage.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.910
You and I can't even hold
each other in our arms!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.860
I don't care if you're a ghost or anything else.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.590
Please stay beside me.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.060
What are you doing?

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.160
Oh, Sora...

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.820
Well... Who is that...

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.900
Oh, she's my friend, Manami.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:11.990
How do you do?

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.100
It's nice to meet you.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:17.040
We were acting out a script
that Mia put on her website.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.510
You want to give it a try too, Sora?

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:19.800
What? Me?

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.140
For Sora, I think this role is perfect.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:22.980
Which one?

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:25.040
A mysterious comical loco girl.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:26.180
What's that?

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:27.580
That sounds like a choice role.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.320
It's perfect! It's perfect!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:31.790
On the other hand, my lines are
embarrassing to read.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.220
But I think girls will love it.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.480
Right? Right?

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.160
It was a great show.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.660
It was great.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.470
Wait, Sora.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.470
It was great.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:17.900
Wait, Sora.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:18.970
Ken...

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.940
Is your body not feeling well?

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.130
What? Not really...

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.700
Please tell me the truth.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:26.370
If you overwork yourself too much,
you will hurt yourself.

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.280
What?

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.610
You've already noticed it yourself,
haven't you?

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.880
You're not as trained as Miss Layla.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.780
And you're doing the same performance
as her every single day.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.040
What do you expect?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.210
I know...

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:41.680
Hey, do you mind if I give you support?

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:42.760
You?

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:44.460
That is if you don't mind.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.230
Just in case, I already
got permission from the Boss.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.030
What I'm going to do is like
thinking of your training menu,

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:50.870
giving you advice what to eat...
that kind of stuff.

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:54.370
In short, I'll be like a trainer.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.270
If it's not too much trouble for you...

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:58.170
How it can be trouble?

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:00.940
So...

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:02.310
The reason why my body is hurting

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.280
is because it cannot keep up
with my performance.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.480
Hey, did you hear?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.950
Karen is also going to quit.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.620
That rumor could really be true.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.290
As I suspected, he's headhunting everyone.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.160
Kaleido Stage is, like, in trouble.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.630
What?

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:19.790
Excuse me...

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:19.790
What?

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:20.430
Excuse me...

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.160
The story you were just talking about...

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:25.430
I think everyone's quitting because
they don't like you playing the lead.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.270
Yes, that's right.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.290
If I were playing the leading role, like,
everything would be much better.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:34.070
Huh? Where is Manami?

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:37.710
When we got back, she wasn't here.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.800
Really?

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:48.690
Hey, the rumor is that everyone is leaving
because I'm playing the leading role...

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:49.780
I wonder if it's true.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:51.890
How could it be true? Are you kidding?

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:55.660
Taking their words seriously,
it's not like you, Sora.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.100
I know...

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:00.540
I also heard the rumor that there
will be another theatrical company.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.540
Kaleido Stage's rival?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.910
So, they're headhunting everybody?

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.770
It's not a big deal. 'Cause we have
Sora, Miss Layla and Mr. Yuri.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.810
All these things she has to deal with...

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:13.750
Sora!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.220
Oh, Manami, you're still here.

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:16.120
You don't want me to stay here?

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:18.920
Oh... No... I didn't mean like that.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.880
One, two... One, two...

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:29.100
One, two... One, two... One, two...

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.790
One, two...

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.230
Good, good. You can do it slowly, okay?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.170
Yes...

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:37.730
I have to work hard and build my muscles.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:41.170
Besides muscles, you ended up with a
boyfriend before I knew it.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:42.710
A boyfriend? Oh, you mean...

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:45.050
No, Ken is not anything like that at all.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:45.840
Not at all...

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.910
I've brought some protein juice.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.350
If you drink it one hour after you work out,

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:54.990
it will help muscles to recover faster.

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:55.790
I'll go get it for you!

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:58.530
Thank you, Ken.

00:10:58.530 --> 00:10:59.990
Wasn't he crying?

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.590
No way...

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.200
Too many things happened today.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.140
Manami, you want to take a bath, don't you?

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.070
Yes. What are you doing?

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.970
Hum? Oh, don't bother...

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.570
I'm doing this for crime prevention.

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:15.480
I've not done anything...

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.270
I've not done anything yet.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:20.580
Sora, you haven't cut your hair
in a while, have you?

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:23.450
Oh, yeah, come to think of it...

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.680
I'll cut your hair for you.

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:30.290
Come to think of it,

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.990
I used to be forced to play
hairdressers and customers.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.900
I was a customer and...

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:35.790
Forced?

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.830
Oh, well... I didn't mean like that.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.030
Huh?

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:47.000
You belong at Kaleido Stage now, don't you?

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:54.150
I've been watching you all day long, Sora.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.580
You pretend to be tough,
acting like everything is cool.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:00.090
But I wonder if, in reality, you might
be crying behind that look.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.610
So, you were concerned about me?

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:05.690
Not, really...

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:09.250
To tell you the truth, I came here to
see your regretful face.

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:11.020
What?

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:21.010
Yes. Yes.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:24.810
Everything is going smoothly.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.840
After I see your show one more time,
I'll be taking an evening flight to Boston.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.280
Manami.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.170
Manami...

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:04.320
One, two... One, two...

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.120
Okay, with a light step!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:10.050
Quietly, like a feather.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:10.630
So, the girl you were with yesterday...

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:11.730
