00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.440
Do you think you're allowed to speak

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.640
Sorry. I'm sorry. I won't do it anymore.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:30.640
during my class?!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:33.150
It's a big mistake if you think you can
get away from being punished

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:34.910
just because you're playing a leading role!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.550
Oh!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:38.550
Mr. Yuri.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:42.060
Excuse me, sir, I would like to
invite Sora to lunch.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:43.020
May I have your permission?

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:43.260
Mr. Yuri...

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:43.260
May I have your permission?

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:43.520
Mr. Yuri...

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.350
Mr. Yuri...

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.350
With Sora?

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.490
Of course.

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:48.260
I will allow anything you ask me to do.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.760
Thank you.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.190
I'm going to have lunch with Mr. Yuri?

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:01.670
Oh, shoot...

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.540
Don't be so nervous.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.710
Well... I wish I could not be nervous.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.980
But, I can't.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:12.180
You're the one I've admired
even before I joined Kaleido Stage.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:15.560
I'm flattered.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.680
In that case, then,

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.190
you wouldn't mind joining me, would you?

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.660
What? What do you mean?

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:24.900
I want you to come to my place

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.490
after you quit Kaleido Stage.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:30.400
What... what did you just say?

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.900
I'm going to withdraw from
Kaleido Stage as of today.

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:38.450
I want you to create a new troupe with me.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:39.950
Mr. Yuri...

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:44.540
In the new troupe, you,
not Layla, will be the top star.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.420
You're... kidding, right?

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:51.590
You would never say that...

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:53.490
You're kidding, aren't you?

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:56.260
I'm not kidding.

00:14:56.260 --> 00:15:01.040
Kaleido Stage is not
as great a place as you think.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.870
Kalos has misled everyone.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.470
I'm not asking you to make up
your mind right away,

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.810
but I think it would be your own benefit
if you decide what you want to do fast.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:13.910
We're in trouble.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.820
After today, 25 people
are going to quit at once.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.450
What are we going to do after tomorrow?

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.690
We have no choice but
to suspend our performance.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:23.720
I guess we have to...

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.820
but I feel sorry for all those kids
who are left here.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.320
I cannot believe this.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.200
Even Mr. Yuri...

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.810
Sora, we're in trouble.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:38.770
What?

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:41.210
After tomorrow, we won't be able to perform.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:45.680
What? We won't?

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:46.670
I don't believe this.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:51.450
After today's show,
25 people are going to quit.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.860
Even Mr. Yuri and the directors are leaving...

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:56.150
We're finished.

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:58.050
No way...

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:03.160
I'm going to withdraw from
Kaleido Stage after today.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:07.160
I want you to create a new troupe with me.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.670
Mr. Yuri really meant it when he said that...

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.380
I beat Kalos.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.630
Fight!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:47.600
Today is the last.

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:53.340
Kaleido Stage...

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.810
...will be gone?

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:24.480
I'm sorry for what happened today.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.910
That's okay. The audience was happy.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.390
Yuri tried to win you over, didn't he?

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:33.480
Yes.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.950
So, are you going?

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:36.620
No.

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:37.960
I see...

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:43.200
It seems that someone offered to buy out
my father's stake in Kaleido Stage.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.370
I heard he was a businessman in Las Vegas.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:50.960
I was aware that Yuri was up to
something for a long time.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:57.240
But I was not able to change his mind.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:06.680
I guess we have no chance
to use this "Pirates" anymore.

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:08.490
It could be...

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:13.650
Losing more than
20 people changes everything.

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.530
I have to go.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.120
Have a nice evening.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:32.280
Thank you for everything, for all this time.

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:34.610
Are you satisfied?

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.050
Yes.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:40.710
Just being able to see you look
like that really gratifies me.

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.300
Sora.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:58.200
I saw your mistake.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.770
Manami...

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:03.740
Sorry for showing you my goof.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.050
Not at all.

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:06.980
I came here to apologize.

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:08.540
What?

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.850
I said something cruel yesterday,

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:14.620
saying that I came here
to see your regretful face.

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:17.480
Because I said that, you...

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.030
No. It's not like that.

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:21.460
I didn't make a mistake because of you.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:25.030
Kaleido Stage is in serious trouble now,

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:28.900
and we cannot perform
for a while after tomorrow.

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:32.500
After I was finally able to co-star
with Miss Layla too...

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:35.310
Will Kaleido Stage be gone?

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:37.780
I don't know.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:43.650
Would you still not regret coming here,
even if Kaleido Stage disappears?

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:46.850
No. No regrets.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.060
Why?

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.890
Because, it was my dream.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:57.160
I've always thought you were pretty dumb...

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.650
But you really ARE dumb.

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.000
But, I envy you.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:06.410
I wanted to be a hairdresser.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:07.610
Really?

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:10.210
But I always got good grades.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:12.480
So my parents expected me to do
something more than that.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:15.980
The reason why I decided to study overseas
was because it was getting stifling.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.890
A hairstylist? That's nice.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.880
I support you.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.090
That's why you're dumb.

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:25.490
Usually, things are not that simple.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.550
Oh... really?

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:31.430
I can't be like you, Sora.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:36.600
That's why I think I wanted to feel relieved
by looking at your regretful face.

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:43.510
I'm not strong at all.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.740
Please cut my hair again.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:51.090
I'm your first customer.

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:56.080
No matter what kind of career
you choose, I support you.

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:00.690
I will try to do something about
Kaleido Stage.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.460
Even if I keep worrying about it,
wondering it may be gone,

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.300
there is nothing I can do about it.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:07.300
Instead, I should do something so that
Kaleido Stage will not go away.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.170
Right?

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:11.660
I guess even you can give
serious thought to things like that.

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:14.000
In my own way...

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:20.550
Well, I need to be going.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.420
All right.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.940
Well, see you later.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.150
Oh, by the way,

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:26.850
don't sleep without covering your stomach.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.340
Okay.

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.700
So what do you think about
Mia's story, Boss?

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:53.510
I knew it! He doesn't like it.

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.110
Sora, it's impossible!

00:21:57.890 --> 00:21:58.720
No.

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.350
See? As I thought...

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:04.190
But, Boss, if we use this story,

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.160
we may be able to put on a fun show
even though we don't have many people.

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:07.020
One week...

00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:11.260
Make it so you can perform this
on stage in one week.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.270
Yes!

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:22.340
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:25.840
I might have gone beyond Shakespeare.

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:30.220
And so, Mia played a great active role
by directing the script she wrote.

00:22:30.220 --> 00:22:32.490
While Mr. Yuri's headhunting continues,

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:35.010
the only thing we can do is do our best.

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.790
Miss Layla is against what we're doing,

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:40.250
but I positively know Mia can pull it off.
I know she can! I know she can!

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:42.290
Next time on Kaleido Star,

00:22:42.660 --> 00:22:43.000
"Fire It Up!"

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:43.460
Fire It Up! Amazing Mia

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:43.460
"Fire It Up!"

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:44.700
Fire It Up! Amazing Mia

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:44.700
"Amazing Mia"

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:45.100
Fire It Up! Amazing Mia

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:47.330
Fire It Up! Amazing Mia

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:47.330
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:48.130
Fire It Up! Amazing Mia

00:22:51.540 --> 00:23:04.320
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:22:51.540 --> 00:23:04.320
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:18.130
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:18.130
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru
Mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:24.100
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:24.100
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:31.450
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:31.450
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:36.780
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:36.780
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:44.190
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:44.190
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>
